request.description:
Create a scheduled chat session for medical appointments (doctors only).

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: appointment_joined**: Notifies when the appointment chat is joined.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_joined', (data) => {
    console.log('Joined appointment chat:', data.appointmentChat);
    initializeAppointmentUI(data.room);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function createAppointmentChat() {
  const appointmentData = {
    appointmentId: "apt123",
    patientId: "user789",
    scheduledStartTime: "2025-06-15T14:00:00Z",
    scheduledEndTime: "2025-06-15T14:30:00Z",
    settings: { autoCloseEnabled: true, preJoinAllowed: false, postChatDuration: 300 }
  };
  const response = await chatService.createAppointmentChat(appointmentData);
  console.log('Appointment chat created:', response.data);
}
```

Retrieve appointment chats for the authenticated user (as doctor or patient).

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function getAppointmentChats(status) {
  const response = await chatService.getAppointmentChats(status);
  console.log('Appointment chats:', response.data);
}
```

Get detailed status and timing information for an appointment chat.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: check_appointment_status**: Client emits to check appointment status.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('check_appointment_status', {
    appointmentChatId: 'appointment-uuid'
  });
  ```
- **Event: appointment_status**: Notifies of appointment status updates.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_status', (status) => {
    console.log('Appointment status:', status.timeStatus);
    console.log('Time until start:', status.timeUntilStart);
    updateAppointmentTimer(status);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (React Component):**
```typescript
useEffect(() => {
  socket?.emit('check_appointment_status', { appointmentChatId });
  socket?.on('appointment_status', (status) => {
    setAppointmentStatus(status);
    setCanJoin(status.timeStatus === 'active' || status.preJoinAllowed);
  });
}, [socket, appointmentChatId]);
```

Join a scheduled appointment chat session.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: join_appointment_chat**: Client emits to join an appointment chat.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('join_appointment_chat', {
    appointmentChatId: 'appointment-uuid'
  });
  ```
- **Event: appointment_joined**: Notifies when successfully joined.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_joined', (data) => {
    console.log('Joined appointment chat:', data.appointmentChat);
    initializeAppointmentUI(data.room);
  });
  ```
- **Event: appointment_join_denied**: Notifies if join attempt is denied.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_join_denied', (data) => {
    console.log('Cannot join:', data.reason);
    if (data.availableAt) {
      console.log('Available at:', data.availableAt);
    }
  });
  ```
- **Event: appointment_participant_joined**: Notifies when another participant joins.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_participant_joined', (data) => {
    console.log(`${data.user.name} joined the appointment`);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (React Component):**
```typescript
const joinAppointment = () => {
  socket?.emit('join_appointment_chat', { appointmentChatId });
};
```

End an active appointment chat session.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: appointment_ended**: Notifies when the appointment chat ends.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('appointment_ended', (data) => {
    console.log('Appointment ended');
    showAppointmentEndedUI(data.appointmentChat);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function endAppointmentChat(appointmentChatId) {
  await chatService.endAppointmentChat(appointmentChatId);
  console.log('Appointment chat ended');
}
```
